Feature: Refund tickets of an order
  The buyer of an order refunds its tickets until 48 hours before the event starts. A refund is the prices
  paid for the tickets, in the currency of the order; a USED, REFUNDED or VOID ticket is not refundable.

  Scenario Outline: A refund pays back the prices of the tickets in the currency of the order, with a TicketRefunded per ticket
    When I run "request_refund" with:
      | idempotency_key | order_id                             | ticket_codes                             | caller                                       | called_at                | stored_order | stored_tickets | show                                                                                                                                                                                            |
      | refund-key-1    | 7c9d8e10-3a4b-4c5d-8e6f-7a8b9c0d1e2f | ["ABCDEFGH23456789", "ZYXWVUTS98765432"] | {"caller_id": "ada", "caller_role": "buyer"} | 2026-12-10T19:59:59.999Z | <order>      | <tickets>      | {"event_id": "6f1c2d3e-4a5b-4c6d-8e7f-0a1b2c3d4e5f", "organizer_id": "org-1", "starts_at": "2026-12-12T20:00:00Z", "time_zone": "Europe/Paris", "local_starts_at": "2026-12-12T21:00:00+01:00"} |
    Then the output is "granted_refund":
      | refund                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 | refunded_tickets                                                                                                                     | tickets_refunded                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
      | {"refund_id": "1d2e3f40-5a6b-4c7d-8e9f-0a1b2c3d4e5f", "order_id": "7c9d8e10-3a4b-4c5d-8e6f-7a8b9c0d1e2f", "ticket_codes": ["ABCDEFGH23456789", "ZYXWVUTS98765432"], "refund_amount": {"amount_minor": 8000, "currency": "<currency>"}} | [{"ticket_code": "ABCDEFGH23456789", "ticket_status": "REFUNDED"}, {"ticket_code": "ZYXWVUTS98765432", "ticket_status": "REFUNDED"}] | [{"message_id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001", "event_id": "6f1c2d3e-4a5b-4c6d-8e7f-0a1b2c3d4e5f", "ticket_code": "ABCDEFGH23456789", "occurred_at": "2026-12-10T19:59:59.999Z"}, {"message_id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002", "event_id": "6f1c2d3e-4a5b-4c6d-8e7f-0a1b2c3d4e5f", "ticket_code": "ZYXWVUTS98765432", "occurred_at": "2026-12-10T19:59:59.999Z"}] |

